        {
          "text": "Nkabela banunwidwe ba-Jehova bayooboola akuza bwiimba kusikila ku-Zioni, Bayooba alukondo lutamani amitwe yabo, Bayoojana lukondo abusekelezi, elyo buusu akutongela zyoonse ziyoocijilila.",
